<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 17.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 17.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Monday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- At the end of a two-day visit to Mozambique World Bank President James Wolfensohn says the benefits of economic growth are reaching a growing number of Mozambicans.</p>
<p>- Rescue workers assisted by South African helicopters have saved seven people stranded by floodwaters around the Zambezi river in central Mozambique.</p>
</text>
